# Prebuilt PyInstaller engine bundles. GitHub hard-rejects individual blobs
# over 100MB (torch/lib/libtorch_cpu.dylib alone is 150-430MB depending on
# arch) — building these locally via scripts/package-engine.sh, or via CI
# (.github/workflows/build-windows.yml), is the only viable path.
